---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Support and Feedback">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Support and Feedback</h1>

    <div class="docs-info">
      <p><strong>Make use of the Feedback and Support section in the Banner All Over app.</strong><br />
        You'll get direct contact and faster replies.</p>
    </div>
    
    <h2>Feedback Section</h2>
    <p>We value your input! Communicate with our team:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Report bugs or issues</li>
      <li>Suggest new features or improvements</li>
      <li>Share ideas for new apps</li>
      <li>Tell us about your experience</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Your Voice Matters:</strong> Many of our best features came from user suggestions. Don't hesitate to share your ideas with us!</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Support Section</h2>
    <p>Access help resources:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Answers to common questions</li>
      <li>Tips for maximizing app usage</li>
      <li>Best practices and tutorials</li>
      <li>
        Contact the support team
        <ul>
          <li>Response time: Maximum 24 hours</li>
          <li>Available via email and in-app messaging</li>
          <li>Priority support for premium plans</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-info">
      <h3>Before Contacting Support</h3>
      <p>To help us assist you faster, please have ready:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>A clear description of your issue</li>
        <li>Screenshots if applicable</li>
        <li>Steps to reproduce the problem</li>
        <li>Your store URL</li>
        <li>Banner name or ID (if relevant)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Common Questions</h2>

    <h3>How do I update my banner?</h3>
    <p>Simply click the edit button on any banner from your dashboard. Changes are automatically saved and can be published whenever you're ready.</p>

    <h3>Can I use the same banner on multiple pages?</h3>
    <p>Yes! You can target the same banner to appear on multiple page types (homepage, collections, products, cart). Just configure the placement settings accordingly.</p>

    <h3>What happens if I delete a banner?</h3>
    <p>Deleted banners are permanently removed and cannot be recovered. Consider duplicating important banners before making major changes.</p>

    <h3>How do I optimize banner performance?</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Use optimized images (WebP format recommended)</li>
      <li>Keep slide count reasonable (3-5 slides is ideal)</li>
      <li>Test on multiple devices</li>
      <li>Use clear, compelling calls-to-action</li>
      <li>Monitor analytics to see what works</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Stay Updated:</strong> Check the Documentation section regularly for new tutorials, tips, and announcements about new features.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Emergency Support</h2>
    <p>For critical issues affecting your store:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Mark your support ticket as "Urgent"</li>
      <li>We prioritize urgent requests</li>
      <li>Emergency response within 4 hours for premium plans</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>For urgent matters:</strong> Contact us using the contact form within the app.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 mb-8">
      <button
        id="contactFormToggle"
        class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-bao-blue-50 to-bao-purple-50 rounded-lg border border-bao-blue-200 hover:border-bao-blue-300 transition-all duration-200"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="contactFormContent"
      >
        <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Contact Us</span>
        <svg
          id="contactFormIcon"
          class="w-6 h-6 text-bao-blue-600 transition-transform duration-300"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        >
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
        </svg>
      </button>

      <div
        id="contactFormContent"
        class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out"
        style="max-height: 0;"
      >
        <div class="p-6 bg-white border border-t-0 border-bao-blue-200 rounded-b-lg">

          <form id="contactForm" class="space-y-4">
            <div>
              <label for="subject" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">
                Subject
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                id="subject"
                name="subject"
                class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-bao-blue-400 focus:border-bao-blue-400 outline-none transition-all"
                placeholder="What can we assist you with today?"
                required
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">
                Email
              </label>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="email"
                name="email"
                class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-bao-blue-400 focus:border-bao-blue-400 outline-none transition-all"
                placeholder="your@email.com"
                required
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">
                Message
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="message"
                name="message"
                rows="5"
                class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-bao-blue-400 focus:border-bao-blue-400 outline-none transition-all resize-none"
                placeholder="Tell us more..."
                required
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <!-- Privacy Notice -->
            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4">
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                By submitting this form, you agree to our <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}legal/privacy`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
                We will use your email address to respond to your inquiry. Your information will be handled in accordance with applicable data protection laws.
              </p>
            </div>

            <button
              type="submit"
              class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-bao-blue-500 to-bao-purple-500 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg hover:from-bao-blue-600 hover:to-bao-purple-600 transition-all duration-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg"
            >
              Send Message
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script>
      const toggle = document.getElementById('contactFormToggle');
      const content = document.getElementById('contactFormContent');
      const icon = document.getElementById('contactFormIcon');
      const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');

      if (toggle && content && icon) {
        toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const isExpanded = toggle.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';

          if (isExpanded) {
            // Collapse
            content.style.maxHeight = '0';
            toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
            icon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
          } else {
            // Expand
            content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + 'px';
            toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
            icon.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';
          }
        });
      }

      if (form) {
        form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
          alert('This is a dummy form. No message will be sent.');
        });
      }
    </script>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12">
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/account-management`} class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Account Management
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-bao-blue-50 to-bao-purple-50 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-bao-blue-400">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Ready to get started?</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Now that you know everything about <strong>Banners All Over</strong>, it's time to create your first banner and start converting visitors into customers!</p>
      <a href="https://apps.shopify.com/banners-all-over" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">
        Visit the Shopify App Store
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
